id: freertos_heap_3
label: FreeRTOS Heap 3
package: freertos
description: 'A heap implementation for FreeRTOS.

  Implementation of pvPortMalloc() and vPortFree() that relies on the memory manager own malloc() and free() implementations.

  This file can only be used if the linker is configured to generate a heap memory area.

  '
category: RTOS|FreeRTOS
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: freertos
source:
- path: kernel/portable/MemMang/heap_3.c
provides:
- name: freertos_heap
- name: freertos_heap_3
- name: freertos_heap_3_arch
  condition:
  - device_cortexm
requires:
- name: cmsis_core
- name: freertos
- name: memory_manager
- name: freertos_heap_3_arch
template_contribution:
- name: rte_components
  value: RTE_RTOS_FreeRTOS_HEAP_3
root_path: freertos
